    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Traceback</i> is an ultra-realistic multiplayer first-person shooter developed with the latest advancements of Unreal Engine 5. Designed to push the boundaries of realism and photorealism, <i>Traceback</i> offers players an immersive experience where every choice, every action, and every moment matters. The game is being created by a passionate team dedicated to delivering a revolutionary shooter experience, and it\u2019s focused on providing intense, bodycam-style firefights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/b3982b3b7d766e505669d9128c5ffa66.poster.avif?t=1753955392\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/b3982b3b7d766e505669d9128c5ffa66.webm?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/b3982b3b7d766e505669d9128c5ffa66.mp4?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>NEXT-GENERATION EXPERIENCE</strong><br><strong></strong><br>With the groundbreaking capabilities of Unreal Engine 5, <i>Traceback</i> delivers a next-generation gaming experience, showcasing the future of realistic video games. Featuring breathtaking graphics, immersive sound design, and an innovative shooting and movement system, the game is designed to provide an unparalleled level of realism, redefining the genre and setting new standards for future shooters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/30285802bcc6222075d8420af880c019.poster.avif?t=1753955392\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/30285802bcc6222075d8420af880c019.webm?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/30285802bcc6222075d8420af880c019.mp4?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE COMBAT AND STRATEGY</strong><br><strong></strong><br><i>Traceback</i> offers a heart-pounding gameplay experience with every moment. Work with your team to strategize and outmaneuver your opponents using your equipment. Realistic environments and detailed maps require tactical thinking at every turn. Enjoy classic modes like Deathmatch and Team Deathmatch, as well as the competitive mode. Success will depend on teamwork and communication!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/e6f80270a39df704fe1979d670e649d8.poster.avif?t=1753955392\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/e6f80270a39df704fe1979d670e649d8.webm?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/e6f80270a39df704fe1979d670e649d8.mp4?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Traceback</i> is an ultra-realistic multiplayer first-person shooter developed with the latest advancements of Unreal Engine 5. Designed to push the boundaries of realism and photorealism, <i>Traceback</i> offers players an immersive experience where every choice, every action, and every moment matters. The game is being created by a passionate team dedicated to delivering a revolutionary shooter experience, and it\u2019s focused on providing intense, bodycam-style firefights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/b3982b3b7d766e505669d9128c5ffa66.poster.avif?t=1753955392\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/b3982b3b7d766e505669d9128c5ffa66.webm?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/b3982b3b7d766e505669d9128c5ffa66.mp4?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>NEXT-GENERATION EXPERIENCE</strong><br><strong></strong><br>With the groundbreaking capabilities of Unreal Engine 5, <i>Traceback</i> delivers a next-generation gaming experience, showcasing the future of realistic video games. Featuring breathtaking graphics, immersive sound design, and an innovative shooting and movement system, the game is designed to provide an unparalleled level of realism, redefining the genre and setting new standards for future shooters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/30285802bcc6222075d8420af880c019.poster.avif?t=1753955392\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/30285802bcc6222075d8420af880c019.webm?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/30285802bcc6222075d8420af880c019.mp4?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE COMBAT AND STRATEGY</strong><br><strong></strong><br><i>Traceback</i> offers a heart-pounding gameplay experience with every moment. Work with your team to strategize and outmaneuver your opponents using your equipment. Realistic environments and detailed maps require tactical thinking at every turn. Enjoy classic modes like Deathmatch and Team Deathmatch, as well as the competitive mode. Success will depend on teamwork and communication!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/e6f80270a39df704fe1979d670e649d8.poster.avif?t=1753955392\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/e6f80270a39df704fe1979d670e649d8.webm?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654830/extras/e6f80270a39df704fe1979d670e649d8.mp4?t=1753955392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
